  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">WA Government donation to the World Food Programme&apos;s  humanitarian aid in Myanmar</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Western Australian Government made a donation to support the World Food Programme&#x2019;s (WFP) crisis relief efforts across the North West and South East of Myanmar. The aid was directed to support immediate needs such as food supplies; to support displaced peoples residing in rural and remote locations of Myanmar (including the remote communities of Chin, Kachin, Kayah and Kayin state); and channelled through a humanitarian agency with on-ground partners to deliver support with a broad reach and local understanding of community need in the targeted areas.</narrative>
  </description>
